icient attempt, conclude_work_inconclusive can preserve an unsuccessful result after pending retrieval is resolved. Complete only after the required tool succeeds. Finish only after reviewing relevant persisted evidence and the displayed completion conditions. The final summary must answer the actual question from those sources, identify source titles and preserve uncertainty. Read counts alone do not justify completion. Use inconclusive if the contract cannot produce a supported conclusion. Do not invent evidence or IDs, include chain-of-thought, markdown, or multi-step plans.\n\nWhen current_work is absent, use the legacy ModelResponse schema provided by the response format. In that mode, keep any rationale concise and copy only IDs explicitly supplied in context."},{"role":"user","content":"{\"task\":{\"goal\":\"Bound provider attempts\",\"focus\":{\"type\":\"question\",\"id\":\"b47bdb8e-38d7-433d-b58c-7a72a56bcc9e\"},\"current_work\":{\"id\":\"52cd67ed-b324-4ed1-8392-398f1ea629fa\",\"project_id\":\"bb0842f6-2d98-442c-b6e7-362dad9e6af9\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-12T15:22:24.920639300Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-12T15:22:24.947821600Z\",\"version\":3,\"archived\":false,\"branch_id\":\"23286b0e-6077-40b5-9102-36d25b9b7f8e\",\"kind\":\"diagnostic\",\"granularity\":\"composite\",\"title\":\"Work\",\"objective\":\"Original objective v1\",\"acceptance_criteria\":{\"required_entities\":[{\"type\":\"question\",\"id\":\"b47bdb8e-38d7-433d-b58c-7a72a56bcc9e\"}],\"required_artifacts\":[],\"minimum_children\":0},\"status\":\"running\",\"owner\":{\"type\":\"human\",\"identity\":\"p0-owner\"},\"capability_requirements\":[\"tool:compute\"],\"context_policy_id\":\"bounded-v1\",\"budget\":{\"context_tokens\":4096,\"max_model_calls\":4,\"max_tool_calls\":8},\"created_by\":{\"type\":\"human\",\"identity\":\"p0-owner\"},\"outcome\":null},\"required_tool_succeeded\":false,\"retrieval_pending\":false,\"retrieval_source_handles\":[]},\"decision_state\":{\"work\":\"52cd67ed-b324-4ed1-83